00:22:09.270 --> 00:22:12.270
<b>ENDING THEME 

00:22:36.990 --> 00:22:37.840
Agumon!

00:22:37.840 --> 00:22:39.280
Let's look for Yggdrasil!

00:22:39.280 --> 00:22:41.790
Aniki, this guy says he knows where he is!

00:22:41.790 --> 00:22:42.780
That helps!

00:22:42.780 --> 00:22:44.120
Wait, it's Gotsumon!

00:22:44.120 --> 00:22:45.610
You... You're alive?!

00:22:45.610 --> 00:22:47.230
There's no time for that!

00:22:47.230 --> 00:22:49.760
We're surrounded by Ultimate Level Digimon!

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:50.700
These guys...

00:22:50.700 --> 00:22:52.690
They say they're guardians of Yggdrasil!

00:22:52.690 --> 00:22:53.680
Interesting!

00:22:53.680 --> 00:22:55.690
I'll take you all on!

00:22:55.690 --> 00:22:57.130
Digimon Savers:

00:22:57.130 --> 00:22:58.220
The Strongest Group of Knights!

00:22:58.220 --> 00:23:00.030
The Royal Knights Assemble!

00:23:00.030 --> 00:23:02.290
Awaken in my fist, Digisoul!

00:23:02.290 --> 00:23:05.320
The Strongest Group of Knights

00:23:02.290 --> 00:23:05.320
The Royal Knights Assemble!
